      "id": "e1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000100",
      "name": "Note",
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## EU Remote Jobs Scraper\n\nScrapes remote job listings from euremotejobs.com via WordPress REST API.\n\n**Schedule:** Every 15 minutes\n**Source:** `euremotejobs`\n**API:** `/wp-json/wp/v2/job-listings`\n\n1. Get criteria from Job Hunter API\n2. Resolve criteria to WP tag IDs\n3. Fetch jobs per tag\n4. Parse, dedup & send to API",
